    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "GeorgeScuba",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101090248971630945174/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUpK8JsveGIjNiSTim0Rcr1N-4rv-LCJhC_Gg9mQAXmINF38C1j=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Unforunately, bad service experience here.  Called to see if certain frames are in-stock, was told yes and booked appointement.  Arrived on time for appointment, sorry we don't have the frames, we'll order.  Got a call a week later, we received the frames, book another appointment.  Get there, sorry, your appointment was for 1 hour earlier (when I'm at work) which I would never have booked.  Waited around for 20 minutes, then left.  Get a call to book a new appointment; no apology, no explanation, just yes we understand here's another appointment.\nSorry, no thanks.  I already wasted enough time coming here twice.",
        "time": 1763577612,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Adrienne S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108142834884532673726/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ6Jea2o6laL2fyjXr2npXBfX8rjDM9H1ZsuhazI7sVqQJaKw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Paid for an emergency apt for an eye infection ($$), however the MD was determined to sell me her $50 eye drops for dry eyes, along with antibiotics. My symptoms were definitely that of an infection and even after my treatment during the follow-up the drops were pushed on me for purchase a second time. Felt a little like the US medical system.... not my style of healthcare.",
        "time": 1761184155,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Andrea Ballara",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115916202754147480660/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWRumKv-ZUAmY9ux2kaw3CQDX2B8n8QgFGY8mbXAdbBze8qFv40=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Was called to pick up my glasses. When I called the person was NOT accommodating and unhelpful. Stating they were understaffed and was not able to let me know how long I would be waiting! The optometrist is excellent. Front desk person NOT helpful",
        "time": 1756312129,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alexandra Yasny",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115900839819361118794/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWGLZ0689Qo4qGcaLcAVqpWjNXltMvv77U60DOQ1pEvXgKqkUf8IQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Very unprofessional and rude! Called today to get information about specific lenses for my child. First of all if you don't have a file with them they even don't try to be nice. Second when I asked a question about the lenses they just brush me of and told me they will not discover the info by phone(my question was about the max cyl range of the lenses since my daughter has very high cyl) and told me to google it! Yeah...very helpful!\nIf you don't know the answer maybe just google yourself first(friendly suggestion).\nCalled to New Look and the nice lady gave me all the info right away and was super nice!",
        "time": 1721147962,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Suzie Breton",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110342577288033528587/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJh4i1mAac8G3Ln6J33tZvvD_vFAyI34cQ-IE-J-Xd5GenDgA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Dr. Anne-Marie Brassard and her staff were so helpful and professional at my recent visit. I was not even a patient of theirs but because I could not be seen by my own optometrist within a reasonable time, she and her staff found a way to accommodate me with an appointment. Then, her service and care were thorough as were her explanations. Further to this, I was given a reference to an ophthalmologist for which they found me a spot within two days! Quite remarkable! I'm very happy with their service and I will most definitely switch to them from now on. They didn't know me and despite this they found a way to see me for an emergency appointment. So grateful! So happy to have found them. Thank you, Dr. Brassard, thank you to the whole team at Opto-Réseau Vaudreuil!",
        "time": 1598480687,
        "translated": false
      }
